#. settings-schema.json->manual_help->description
msgid ""
"Pick Light or Dark from the panel menu and it stays that way — nothing "
"changes it on its own. The night light becomes a switch in that menu too, so"
" you decide when the screen is warmed. Switch back to Automatic whenever you"
" like."
msgstr ""

#. settings-schema.json->appearance_help->description
msgid ""
