#. settings-schema.json->nightlight_help->description
msgid ""
"How yellow the screen goes when the night light is on. Drag left for a "
"deeper yellow, right for closer to normal daylight. In Manual mode you "
"switch the night light on and off from the panel menu; this sets the colour "
"either way."
msgstr ""

